{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_23A3CE44","title":"Find Marcelle","entry":"Dlg_23A3CE44::entry","exit":"Dlg_23A3CE44::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_68E25EBC","articyId":"72057791606438385","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"Well, Nivalis's newest noodle hawker. How is business?","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, Nivalis's newest noodle hawker. How is business?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":75.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25367","byteOffset":17481904,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_15049604","articyId":"72057791606438420","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"Hard work and passion pays off in the end.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hard work and passion pays off in the end.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":675.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35108","byteOffset":25642720,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_84D6A9C0","articyId":"72057791606438441","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"Those lackluster little establishments that cut more corners than a rhombus in a rock polisher? I can't say I've had the \"pleasure\" recently.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Those lackluster little establishments that cut more corners than a rhombus in a rock polisher? I can't say I've had the \"pleasure\" recently.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1275.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25119","byteOffset":17385088,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_B39022B1","articyId":"72057791606438456","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"And why is that?","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And why is that?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1875.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52548","byteOffset":34292168,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_728678A9","articyId":"72057791606438477","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"My child. I know every establishment in every corner of this city.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"My child. I know every establishment in every corner of this city.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31286","byteOffset":19716832,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_CA051976","articyId":"72057791606438492","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"So you will forgive me when I say I detect an aroma of bullshit about you.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So you will forgive me when I say I detect an aroma of bullshit about you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3675.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49495","byteOffset":33066960,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_59B3E9C4","articyId":"72057791606438513","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"Quelle surprise. She always was lazy. And why did you agree to such an odious little errand?","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Quelle surprise. She always was lazy. And why did you agree to such an odious little errand?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4275.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45337","byteOffset":31485464,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_23043C8E","articyId":"72057791606438520","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"I'll be the judge of that. And, I'm afraid to say, of you. Good day.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'll be the judge of that. And, I'm afraid to say, of you. Good day.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4275.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45384","byteOffset":31502488,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_C88A6309","articyId":"72057791606438534","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"A word to the wise, my friend: swap the sugar for salt too many times and you'll be the one who ends up with an ulcer. Understand?","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A word to the wise, my friend: swap the sugar for salt too many times and you'll be the one who ends up with an ulcer. Understand?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4875.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38314","byteOffset":28830120,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_6A918D50","articyId":"72057791606438555","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"There are better ways to succeed. I have a feeling that you'll find them.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There are better ways to succeed. I have a feeling that you'll find them.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5475.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28356","byteOffset":18609712,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_B12CC09E","articyId":"72057821671305168","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"Well, Nivalis's best rat meat chef! How is business?","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, Nivalis's best rat meat chef! How is business?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":75.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43835","byteOffset":30914832,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_6C9E198C","articyId":"72057821671305193","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"A gull could drop a crabstick into a bin fire and I would be there to make sure I wasn't missing out.","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A gull could drop a crabstick into a bin fire and I would be there to make sure I wasn't missing out.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3075.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43336","byteOffset":30723280,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_2914A575","articyId":"72057821671305223","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marcelle DeNuite","text":"I don't like to get played. So ...","speakerId":"Ntt_F55BAE21","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't like to get played. So ...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4275.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27722","byteOffset":18369592,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_88E3731D","articyId":"72057791606438413","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Could be better.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Could be better.","TextSheVersion":"Could be better.","TextTheyVersion":"Could be better."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":375.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37963","byteOffset":28696296,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_5A8ADB1A","articyId":"72057791606438434","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Speaking of hard work... have you eaten at any of Dagmar Fitz's places lately?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Speaking of hard work... have you eaten at any of Dagmar Fitz's places lately?","TextSheVersion":"Speaking of hard work... have you eaten at any of Dagmar Fitz's places lately?","TextTheyVersion":"Speaking of hard work... have you eaten at any of Dagmar Fitz's places lately?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":975.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22344","byteOffset":16338824,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_4616DF85","articyId":"72057791606438449","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Then you're missing out.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Then you're missing out.","TextSheVersion":"Then you're missing out.","TextTheyVersion":"Then you're missing out."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1575.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file